        "description": "Seeds /administrivia/batch: a generic batch viewer (tap_web batch-viewer panel) under the Administrivia backend section, with a sequence-nav selector. Shows what any batch added (nodes + edges), deleted, and purged. Latest batch by default; deep-link via batch_entity_id."
